    "detailed_description": "Midnight Looters is a 1-4 player co-op horror adventure game where you and your friends search for valuable items and treasures in abandoned, mysterious forests. This game requires teamwork and strategy, as players explore dark woods filled with dangerous spiritual entities. The dangers you may encounter during your treasure hunt include supernatural beings that can surprise you at any moment.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBy collecting valuable items and treasures, you can purchase different equipment in the game and continue your adventures with greater strength. With the money you earn, you can obtain more advanced tools and equipment to increase your chances of success. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nSo, what kind of treasure hunter will you be? Can you unravel the secrets hidden deep within the forests?",
